The power of the Fearscape infuses your weapon: Your melee attacks will deal [23, 31, 37, 42, 46 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire damage, spread over 3 turns.

Additionally, every time you attack, there is a 25% chance of releasing a burst of powerful fire that will deal [90, 121, 145, 165, 183 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire damage to all enemies in radius [1, 1, 1, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] over 3 turns.

If this talent is not on cooldown, the burst of fire will instead be radius [2, 3, 4, 4, 4 (TL1-5)], and stun all targets in addition to burning them.

For the purposes of applying the stun, you have [5, 10, 15, 20, 25 (TL1-5)] bonus spellpower.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
